  "debugNotes": [
    "Night hospital ward after ambulance. Keep this as a separate room from office and ambulance content.",
    "The ward runtime composition intentionally uses local clean OBJ props only. Heavy imported GLB references stay out of the playable room to preserve loading time and visual readability.",
    "Primary read: patient wakes at the bed head, sees the headwall, monitor, IV stand, bedside table, curtain, window and locked corridor door without dense background clutter.",
    "After the wakeup sequence, R exits the bed to the bed_stand spawn and returns normal player control."
  ]
